one small issue on our implementation of [https://github.com/PJensen/jshack/issues/187](https://github.com/PJensen/jshack/issues/187) remains -- namely that weapons still show damage as "1d6" instead of the average damage.&#x20;

NOTE: underlying weapon, etc, still uses the DND notation. this is expected

I saw the notation still present in the item tooltips.

